From 26a9dcb74362510270f260a234f00a5bd77048af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xuejia <xuejia@codeaurora.org>
Date: Thu, 2 Mar 2017 14:42:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Customize signal cluster for China carriers

1. Update Chinese roaming string.
2. Show rsrp level for LTE.
3. Redesign the scheme of selecting icons on signal cluster. Customized
SigalClusterView and MobileSignalController to adapt requirement from
China carriers. The customization is controller by config values defined
in overlayed config.xml.

Change-Id: Ie78865457e831889214fffed2b95c5b03d335877
